cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Craton, please cite it like this."
title: "Craton: one model for the solid Earth"
abstract: >-
  A foundation model for geology built the way LLMs are built: one token format for every
  measurement on Earth, masked modelling across space and time with 4D positions, probabilistic
  outputs only, and a benchmark suite (CratonBench) guarded by a ratchet.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ahmed
    family-names: Hesham
repository-code: "https://github.com/AhmedHeshamEG/craton"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
keywords:
  - seismology
  - earthquakes
  - foundation model
  - transformer
  - probabilistic forecasting
